{"id":"68fb21596025bb57","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-limit.md","title":"Limit","display":"df-limit — Limit","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-limit","aliases":["58-df-limit","Limit"],"display":"df-limit — Limit","depends_on":["[[58-df-directed-set]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-topology]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-limit"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-limit</span><span>Limit</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-limit — Limit"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e61c089fc5e610a6\" href=\"?note=e61c089fc5e610a6\" title=\"58-df-directed-set\">58-df-directed-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e7514bc4cefba4f2\" href=\"?note=e7514bc4cefba4f2\" title=\"58-df-topology\">58-df-topology</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,\\preceq,X,\\tau,x,x_\\infty\\in V\">\\(I,\\preceq,X,\\tau,x,x_\\infty\\in V\\)</span> (set-theoretic parameters)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Directed}_S(I,\\preceq)\">\\(\\mathrm{Directed}_S(I,\\preceq)\\)</span> (directed preorder, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e61c089fc5e610a6\" href=\"?note=e61c089fc5e610a6\" title=\"58-df-directed-set\">58-df-directed-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\">\\(\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\\)</span> (topological-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e7514bc4cefba4f2\" href=\"?note=e7514bc4cefba4f2\" title=\"58-df-topology\">58-df-topology</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(x,I,X)\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(x,I,X)\\)</span> (net function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Lim}_{I,\\preceq;X,\\tau}(x,x_\\infty)\">\\(\\operatorname{Lim}_{I,\\preceq;X,\\tau}(x,x_\\infty)\\)</span> (fully parameterized net-limit predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}limit} \\vdash \\operatorname{Lim}_{I,\\preceq;X,\\tau}(x,x_\\infty)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Directed}_S(I,\\preceq)\\land\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(x,I,X)\\land x_\\infty\\in X\\land\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;\\Bigl(x_\\infty\\in U\\to\\exists i_0\\in I\\;\\forall i\\in I\\;(\\langle i_0,i\\rangle\\in\\preceq\\to x(i)\\in U)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}limit} \\vdash \\operatorname{Lim}_{I,\\preceq;X,\\tau}(x,x_\\infty)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Directed}_S(I,\\preceq)\\land\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(x,I,X)\\land x_\\infty\\in X\\land\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;\\Bigl(x_\\infty\\in U\\to\\exists i_0\\in I\\;\\forall i\\in I\\;(\\langle i_0,i\\rangle\\in\\preceq\\to x(i)\\in U)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Limit: eventual containment in neighborhoods</li>\n<li>Direct limits are defined separately in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"3a9f5d3a8e080215\" href=\"?note=3a9f5d3a8e080215\" title=\"58-df-direct-limit\">58-df-direct-limit</a></li>\n<li>Limit of sequence: special case of net limit</li>\n<li>Completeness: every Cauchy sequence converges</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Munkres, Topology, Chapter 3</li>\n<li>Mac Lane, Categories for the Working Mathematician</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-directed-set","status":"resolved","id":"e61c089fc5e610a6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-directed-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-topology","status":"resolved","id":"e7514bc4cefba4f2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-topology]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-directed-set","status":"resolved","id":"e61c089fc5e610a6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Directed}_S(I,\\preceq)$ (directed preorder, see [[58-df-directed-set]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-topology","status":"resolved","id":"e7514bc4cefba4f2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)$ (topological-space predicate, see [[58-df-topology]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}(x,I,X)$ (net function, see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-direct-limit","status":"resolved","id":"3a9f5d3a8e080215","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"Direct limits are defined separately in [[58-df-direct-limit]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"I,\\preceq,X,\\tau,x,x_\\infty\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Directed}_S(I,\\preceq)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}(x,I,X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Lim}_{I,\\preceq;X,\\tau}(x,x_\\infty)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}limit} \\vdash \\operatorname{Lim}_{I,\\preceq;X,\\tau}(x,x_\\infty)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Directed}_S(I,\\preceq)\\land\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(x,I,X)\\land x_\\infty\\in X\\land\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;\\Bigl(x_\\infty\\in U\\to\\exists i_0\\in I\\;\\forall i\\in I\\;(\\langle i_0,i\\rangle\\in\\preceq\\to x(i)\\in U)\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1350,"backlinks":[{"id":"08bb92b5435e7a5a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ba03a59c8208ec05","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ee237308612121cd","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{Lim}(\\kappa)$ (limit index, see [[../batch20/58-df-limit.md]])"},{"id":"2b83d8c1d5e5d7c5","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-86","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-limit]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-780","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-limit.md|58-df-limit]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["e61c089fc5e610a6","36d7463d215be751","e7514bc4cefba4f2","3a9f5d3a8e080215"]}